# Combat damage, presses and additional strikes (docs/flow.md, "Combat"; docs/m6-plan.md M6.4b).
# When the damage step closes, the engine applies the strikes: vampires mend normal damage with
# blood, go to torpor with damage they can't mend, and are burned by aggravated damage they can't
# pay for once wounded; allies lose life and burn at 0. A combatant who leaves ends the combat
# after the end of the round. Seating A B C: A's prey is B, its predator C. Iron Ward stands in for
# a weapon, Quick Feed for a combat card, Gate Hound is an ally.
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Iron Ward" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Gate Hound" *40
start

A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> transfer +3 A:ready:1
B> transfer +1 B:ready:1
A> play "Iron Ward" on A:ready:1
A> next
A> next

# Prevention, then torpor: Tomas takes 3, prevents 1, mends 1 with his only blood, and goes to
# torpor with the last; the combat ends after the end of the round, with no press step.
A> bleed A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
A> strike 3
B> strike hand
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey is about to take 3 damage; Vera Nightfall is about to take 1 damage
expect combat 1 damage close
A> pass
B> prevent 1 via B:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey plays Quick Feed to prevent 1 damage
expect impulse A
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Tomas Grey takes 2 damage (1 blood) and goes to torpor
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
expect count B:torpor 1
expect card B:torpor:1 blood 0
expect card A:ready:1 blood 2
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
B> pass
log public Combat is over; the action was blocked
A> pass
expect action none

# An ally: Gate Hound blocks a hunt. Round 1: it loses a life, and Vera takes an additional
# strike, which only she uses. Presses: to continue, answered by a press to end, pressed again.
C> play "Gate Hound" ready
C> life +4 C:ready:2
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:2
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 1
C> strike hand
A> strike extra
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall takes an additional strike
expect impulse A
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Gate Hound takes 1 damage: −1 life
log public Additional strikes: Vera Nightfall
expect combat 1 strikes close
expect impulse A
A> strike 1
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Vera Nightfall strikes: 1 damage
expect combat 1 damage close
A> pass
C> pass
expect card C:ready:2 life 2
expect card A:ready:1 blood 1
expect combat 1 press close
A> press continue
log public Round 1 · Press: Vera Nightfall presses to continue
reject:not-now A> press continue
A> pass
C> press end
log public Round 1 · Press: Gate Hound presses to end the combat
A> press continue
A> pass
C> pass
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 2 of combat
expect combat 2 before-range close

# Round 2: aggravated damage burns the hound's last life.
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 2A
C> strike hand
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 2 · Damage: Gate Hound takes 2 aggravated and is burned
expect count C:ashHeap 1
expect card A:ready:1 blood 0
expect combat 2 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass
expect action none

# A first strike resolves before the other strike. Then aggravated damage on a vampire with no
# blood: the first point wounds her, the second burns her, and her weapon goes with her.
C> transfer +5 C:ready:1
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> pass
C> block C:ready:1
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass strikes
C> pass strikes
A> strike 1 first
C> strike 2A
log public Round 1 · Damage: Ilse Várga is about to take 1 damage
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Ilse Várga takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall is about to take 2 aggravated damage
expect combat 1 damage close
A> pass
C> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Vera Nightfall takes 2 aggravated and is burned
expect count A:ready 0
expect count A:ashHeap 2
expect card C:ready:1 blood 4
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
A> pass
C> pass
A> pass
expect action none
